menu "roBa custom automouse"

config ROBA_AUTOMOUSE_TYPING_GUARD_MS
    int "Automouse activation delay after normal key press (ms)"
    default 500
    range 0 2000
    help
      Pointer movement is still reported during this period, but movement
      cannot activate the automouse layer. Each normal key press restarts
      the period. Mouse-button positions do not restart it while the
      automouse layer is already active.

endmenu
